          "id": "bee260c7-ffb2-4755-bd41-085eb4164c2f",
          "memory": "Devon's team planned a team lunch for Saturday, September 26, 2026 at 2pm at Domino's by the office, with 5-6 coworkers attending; Devon's boss framed it as good for morale but Devon said he is not going to protect his weekend.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "de4d302e-7d42-4884-a5b8-c16a14f2a6ae",
          "memory": "User and Devon agreed Domino's is no comparison after Luigi's on 5th Street, with Devon saying Luigi's garlic knots ruined other pizza for him.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e662c096-5f62-450b-9850-27de063db6c1",
          "memory": "Devon plans to help his mom with groceries on Saturday afternoon, September 26, 2026 instead of attending the team lunch, and User asked Devon to tell her hi.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "dc853173-ab9e-46cc-918d-3c7c88ff2ae4",
          "memory": "Devon's mom still talks about User demolishing her potato salad at the September 20, 2026 lunch, and Devon said the leftovers she sent home with him are already gone.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2f802610-259e-4572-adeb-7de9f849f146",
          "memory": "On September 22, 2026 User reminded Devon about setting up autopay for electric after Devon admitted forgetting again, and Devon said he would do it on his laptop.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "cfc443f1-affe-4ab8-aa60-daf5e2bd99ef",
          "memory": "On the evening of September 22, 2026 User cooked lemon pepper chicken in the oven while waiting, and Devon planned a lazy dinner of cereal after a long day of meetings.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "590957a7-f401-449e-b15c-592eefd29f5e",
          "memory": "As of September 22, 2026 traffic on 5th Street was still messed up with construction by the bank blocked off, and User has to go that way on Thursday, September 24, 2026 so Devon advised leaving early.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
